lic provident fund, floating rate saving bonds, and national pension system; digital gold and sovereign gold bonds; alternate investment products; insurance services, such as life, general, and health insurance; and various forex products and services. The company was formerly known as UTI Bank Limited and changed its name to Axis Bank Limited in July 2007. Axis Bank Limited was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.\"},\"history\":[{\"timestamp\":1778471100,\"date\":\"2026-05-11T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1258.699951171875,\"high\":1283,\"low\":1251.699951171875,\"close\":1272.300048828125,\"volume\":7341360},{\"timestamp\":1778557500,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1270.4000244140625,\"high\":1274,\"low\":1256.9000244140625,\"close\":1260.0999755859375,\"volume\":5727828},{\"timestamp\":1778643900,\"date\":\"2026-05-13T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1256.0999755859375,\"high\":1275.300048828125,\"low\":1247.5,\"close\":1255.699951171875,\"volume\":6045406},{\"timestamp\":1778730300,\"date\":\"2026-05-14T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1256.5999755859375,\"high\":1269,\"low\":1235.800048828125,\"close\":1254.5999755859375,\"volume\":5822618},{\"timestamp\":1778816700,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1259.5999755859375,\"high\":1263.4000244140625,\"low\":1242,\"close\":1244.800048828125,\"volume\":4805485},{\"timestamp\":1779075900,\"date\":\"2026-05-18T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1239,\"high\":1242,\"low\":1222.0999755859375,\"close\":1237.9000244140625,\"volume\":6052023},{\"timestamp\":1779162300,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1238.5,\"high\":1249.800048828125,\"low\":1231.300048828125,\"close\":1238.300048828125,\"volume\":9200314},{\"timestamp\":1779248700,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1234,\"high\":1254.0999755859375,\"low\":1226.5999755859375,\"close\":1249.800048828125,\"volume\":3562641},{\"timestamp\":1779335100,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T03:45:00.000Z\",\"open\":1256.9000244140625,\"high\":1262.6